lue": ["full_self_consumption"]}, {"field": "requires_same_red_line_for_self_consumption", "value": true}]}}, {"default": {"status": "insufficient", "conclusions": [], "reason": "项目类型未确定（O-R-001 返回 insufficient 或 unclassified）、或大型工商业未提供现货市场地区状态时，无法按第五条给出确定的允许模式；不得反推。"}, "exceptions": ["一般工商业采用自发自用余电上网时，年自发自用电量占发电量的比例由各省级能源主管部门确定；本规则只判“模式是否可选”，不判比例是否达标（缺省级参数）。广东设施农业的 30% 已单列 O-R-004。", "大型工商业在电力现货市场连续运行地区可选余电上网“参与现货市场”，不是无条件余电上网；spot_market_region 未核实为 null 时，只能给“原则上全部自发自用”。", "第三十五条允许投运后按第五条规定变更上网模式一次；本规则判的是可选集合，不判变更次数与流程。", "大型工商业的“原则上全部自发自用”与“现货地区可余电上网”依赖 spot_market_region；该字段为 null（未核实）时规则返回 insufficient，不把未知当作“只能全自发自用”（对应独立复审 B-2）。", "浙江自 2026-08-03 起第四条不再把“现货市场连续运行地区”作为大型工商业余电上网的前提，由 zhejiang_large_industrial_two_modes 分支承接。该分支带 blocks_on_unknown：province 或 policy_as_of 未知时，本规则不许任何后续分支（含国家 spot=false 全自发自用）定论，返回 insufficient 并报出缺的字段；已知省份为浙江且日期早于 2026-08-03 时该分支被明确否定，仍按国家口径判。"]}], "temporal_scope": {"policy_document": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH", "effective_from": "2025-01-23", "effective_to": null}, "claim_status": "supported", "knowledge_kind": "derived", "batch": "pv-national-2025-v1"}
{"record_id": "O-R-003", "record_type": "rule", "text": "新老划断：是否按原有政策执行", "entity_ids": [], "fact_ids": [], "rule_ids": ["O-R-003"], "source_refs": [{"source_id": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH", "locator_id": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH#clause=第四十三条", "kind": "clause", "value": "第四十三条", "quote": "对于本办法发布之日前已备案且于2025年5月1日前并网投产的分布式光伏发电项目", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH", "locator_id": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH#clause=第四十三条", "kind": "clause", "value": "第四十三条", "quote": "仍按原有政策执行", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH", "locator_id": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH#clause=第四十三条", "kind": "clause", "value": "第四十三条", "quote": "本办法自发布之日起施行，有效期五年", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411", "locator_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411#qa=Q71", "kind": "qa", "value": "Q71", "quote": "“发布之日”指《管理办法》对全社会公布日期即2025年1月23日", "evidence_level": "official_qa"}, {"source_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411", "locator_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411#qa=Q71", "kind": "qa", "value": "Q71", "quote": "1月23日当日备案的也属于发布之日前已备案项目", "evidence_level": "official_qa"}, {"source_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411", "locator_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411#qa=Q72", "kind": "qa", "value": "Q72", "quote": "2025年5月1日前（含当日）并网是指分布式光伏发电项目全容量并网", "evidence_level": "official_qa"}, {"source_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411", "locator_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411#qa=Q72", "kind": "qa", "value": "Q72", "quote": "对于部分容量并网的，不能按照原政策执行", "evidence_level": "official_qa"}, {"source_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411", "locator_id": "PV-FAQ-20250411#qa=Q73", "kind": "qa", "value": "Q73", "quote": "在发布之日后进行备案变更，且于2025年5月1日前并网投产的分布式光伏发电项目", "evidence_level": "official_qa"}, {"source_id": "PV-EXPLAIN-20250123", "locator_id": "PV-EXPLAIN-20250123#section=四(一)", "kind": "section", "value": "四(一)", "quote": "对于本办法发布之日前已备案且于2025年5月1日前并网投产的分布式光伏发电项目", "evidence_level": "official_explanation"}], "conditions": [{"case_id": "legacy_policy_applies", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "filing_date", "value": "2025-01-23"}, {"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "grid_connection_date", "value": "2025-05-01"}, {"predicate": "is_true", "field": "grid_connection_full_capacity"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "legacy_policy_applies", "value": true}]}}, {"case_id": "partial_capacity_not_legacy", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "filing_date", "value": "2025-01-23"}, {"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "grid_connection_date", "value": "2025-05-01"}, {"predicate": "is_false", "field": "grid_connection_full_capacity"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "legacy_policy_applies", "value": false}]}}, {"case_id": "late_connection_not_legacy", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "filing_date", "value": "2025-01-23"}, {"predicate": "date_gt", "field": "grid_connection_date", "value": "2025-05-01"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "legacy_policy_applies", "value": false}]}}, {"case_id": "filed_after_publication_not_legacy", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "date_gt", "field": "filing_date", "value": "2025-01-23"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "legacy_policy_applies", "value": false}]}}, {"default": {"status": "insufficient", "conclusions": [], "reason": "备案日期、并网日期或全容量并网状态缺失，无法判定；缺失不等于“不适用原政策”。"}, "exceptions": ["Q71 明确“发布之日”为对全社会公布日期 2025-01-23（含当日），所以备案条件用 date_lte 2025-01-23，不是制发日期 2025-01-17。", "Q72 明确 2025-05-01 前（含当日）并网指全容量并网；部分容量并网不能按原政策执行。", "Q73 明确发布之日后做备案变更、且 2025-05-01 前并网投产的，仍按原政策；故备案变更日期 filing_change_date 不参与判定。"]}], "temporal_scope": {"policy_document": "PV-NAT-2025-007-ATTACH", "effective_from": "2025-01-23", "legacy_cutoff": "2025-05-01"}, "claim_status": "supported", "knowledge_kind": "derived", "batch": "pv-national-2025-v1"}
{"record_id": "O-R-004", "record_type": "rule", "text": "省级余电上网比例：广东设施农业 30% / 浙江不作要求", "entity_ids": [], "fact_ids": [], "rule_ids": ["O-R-004"], "source_refs": [{"source_id": "PV-GD-2025-002", "locator_id": "PV-GD-2025-002#section=二", "kind": "section", "value": "二", "quote": "年自发自用电量占发电量的比例不低于30%", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-GD-2025-002", "locator_id": "PV-GD-2025-002#section=二", "kind": "section", "value": "二", "quote": "于本实施意见发布之日前已获得电网企业支持并网意见", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-GD-2025-002", "locator_id": "PV-GD-2025-002#section=二", "kind": "section", "value": "二", "quote": "如项目于本实施意见生效后2个月内全部建成", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-GD-2025-002", "locator_id": "PV-GD-2025-002#section=二", "kind": "section", "value": "二", "quote": "不对项目年自发自用电量比例作要求", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-GD-2025-002", "locator_id": "PV-GD-2025-002#section=六", "kind": "section", "value": "六", "quote": "本实施意见自2026年2月10日起试行，试行期2年", "evidence_level": "normative"}, {"source_id": "PV-ZJ-2026-015", "locator_id": "PV-ZJ-2026-015#clause=第四条", "kind": "clause", "value": "第四条", "quote": "年自发自用电量占发电量的比例不作要求", "evidence_level": "normative"}], "conditions": [{"case_id": "gd_policy_expired", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "equals", "field": "province", "value": "guangdong"}, {"predicate": "date_gt", "field": "policy_as_of", "value": "2028-02-09"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "provincial_ratio_requirement", "value": "not_applicable"}]}}, {"case_id": "gd_ratio_met", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "equals", "field": "province", "value": "guangdong"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "project_class", "value": "general_industrial_business"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "site_category", "value": "agricultural_structure"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "grid_mode", "value": "self_consumption_surplus_feed_in"}, {"predicate": "gte", "field": "self_consumption_ratio_pct", "value": 30}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "provincial_ratio_requirement", "value": "met"}, {"field": "provincial_ratio_min_pct", "value": 30}]}}, {"case_id": "gd_ratio_exempted", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "equals", "field": "province", "value": "guangdong"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "project_class", "value": "general_industrial_business"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "site_category", "value": "agricultural_structure"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "grid_mode", "value": "self_consumption_surplus_feed_in"}, {"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "filing_date", "value": "2025-01-23"}, {"predicate": "date_lt", "field": "grid_opinion_date", "value": "2025-12-31"}, {"predicate": "date_lte", "field": "construction_completion_date", "value": "2026-04-10"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "provincial_ratio_requirement", "value": "exempted"}, {"field": "provincial_ratio_min_pct", "value": 30}]}}, {"case_id": "gd_ratio_not_met", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "equals", "field": "province", "value": "guangdong"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "project_class", "value": "general_industrial_business"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "site_category", "value": "agricultural_structure"}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "grid_mode", "value": "self_consumption_surplus_feed_in"}, {"predicate": "lt", "field": "self_consumption_ratio_pct", "value": 30}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "provincial_ratio_requirement", "value": "not_met"}, {"field": "provincial_ratio_min_pct", "value": 30}]}}, {"case_id": "zj_no_requirement", "when": {"logic": "all", "conditions": [{"predicate": "equals", "field": "province", "value": "zhejiang"}, {"predicate": "in", "field": "project_class", "value": ["general_industrial_business", "large_industrial_business"]}, {"predicate": "equals", "field": "grid_mode", "value": "self_consumption_surplus_feed_in"}, {"predicate": "date_gte", "field": "policy_as_of", "value": "2026-08-03"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "provincial_ratio_requirement", "value": "no_requirement"}]}}, {"case_id": "provincial_ratio_not_applicable", "when": {"logic": "any", "conditions": [{"predicate": "is_null", "field": "province"}, {"predicate": "not_equals", "field": "province", "value": "guangdong"}, {"predicate": "is_null", "field": "project_class"}, {"predicate": "not_equals", "field": "project_class", "value": "general_industrial_business"}, {"predicate": "is_null", "field": "site_category"}, {"predicate": "not_equals", "field": "site_category", "value": "agricultural_structure"}, {"predicate": "is_null", "field": "grid_mode"}, {"predicate": "not_equals", "field": "grid_mode", "value": "self_consumption_surplus_feed_in"}]}, "then": {"conclusions": [{"field": "provincial_ratio_requirement", "value": "not_applicable"}]}}, {"default": {"status": "insufficient", "conclusions": [], "reason": "广东目标项目（设施农业一般工商业、余电上网，且在粤能规〔2025〕2号试行期内）缺少年自发自用电量比例，且未提供完整豁免三日期；需补 self_consumption_ratio_pct 或 filing_date/grid_opinion_date/construction_completion_date 后再判，不能按缺失数据反推不满足。浙江项目满足省份/类型/上网模式/生效时点即直接判 no_requirement，不会落到本 default。"}, "exceptions": ["30% 只适用于设施农用地上、按广东口径归一般工商业的农业建（构）筑物项目；其他一般工商业现阶段暂不作强制比例要求（本规则判 not_applicable，不代表没有其他要求）。", "浙江只对一般工商业/大型工商业的余电上网判 no_requirement；全部自发自用、以及浙江细则生效（2026-08-03）前或未提供 policy_as_of 的项目判 not_applicable，不视为“浙江免比例”的结论。", "广东 policy_as_of 超过 2028-02-09（试行期满且未见续期文件）判 not_applicable：只表示本规则不再给出 30% 判定，需重新核对是否续期或出台新规。", "豁免还需“经省级能源主管部门会同电网企业确认”，本规则只能判日期条件是否具备，最终以确认结果为准。", "比例按年计算；本规则使用调用方提供的设计/实际年比例，不做月度折算或跨年推算。"]}], "temporal_scope": {"policy_document": "PV-GD-2025-002 / PV-ZJ-2026-015", "effective_from": "2026-02-10", "effective_to": "2030-01-16"}, "claim_status": "supported", "knowledge_kind": "derived", "batch": "pv-national-2025-v1"}
